# Installation state -- per-device, never shared between machines.
# Generated by color_calibration.py and the /admin tag pairing UI. Tracked
# copies live on the installation-state branch (see pi/installation_config.py),
# never on a code branch, so pulls and branch switches cannot clobber them.
pi/color_map.json
pi/puzzles/index.json
# Timestamped copies left behind by 'installation_config.py restore'.
pi/color_map.json.bak-*
pi/puzzles/index.json.bak-*
